42	/**
43	 * Static utility methods pertaining to {@code int} primitives, that are not already found in either
44	 * {@link Integer} or {@link Arrays}.
45	 *
46	 * <p>See the Guava User Guide article on <a
47	 * href="https://github.com/google/guava/wiki/PrimitivesExplained">primitive utilities</a>.
48	 *
